rpt\":\"OpenAI aggiunge una funzione di personal finance: collegando i conti tramite Plaid, ChatGPT mostra spese e performance del portafoglio e risponde a domande di budgeting.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/chatgpt-finances-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"chatgpt-finances\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14898,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T12:30:48+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:54:50+00:00\",\"slug\":\"sei-app-iphone-popolari-arrivano-su-carplay\",\"title\":\"Sei app iPhone popolari arrivano su CarPlay\",\"excerpt\":\"ChatGPT, Perplexity, Grok, Google Meet, WhatsApp e Audiomack sono tra le nuove app iPhone disponibili su CarPlay. Ecco cosa offrono.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-WWDC25-iOS-26-CarPlay-Light-mode-250609-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-WWDC25-iOS-26-CarPlay-Light-mode-250609\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14896,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T10:45:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:53:16+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-valuta-azioni-legali-contro-apple-partnership-tesa-siri\",\"title\":\"OpenAI valuta azioni legali contro Apple per la partnership “tesa” con Siri\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, OpenAI starebbe valutando opzioni legali contro Apple per una partnership con Siri giudicata “tesa”, con integrazione e promozione 